  "engine": "racket",
  "description": "ITF Rule 14 (Order of Service), doubles: the internal service order (which of each side's two players opens their side's service) is reconfigurable at the start of every set via SERVICE_ORDER_CONFIGURED, while which side serves the set's first game stays the mechanical continuation of the match's continuous rotation (here: 6 games, even, so side_a still opens segment 1). Before any SERVICE_ORDER_CONFIGURED event for a segment, needsServiceConfiguration gates it and the engine falls back to the persisted order walked locally from the segment's own boundary.",
